      "sentZh": "今天星期五，放学了，爸爸在车上告诉我：“下午有一个小朋友来我们家。”",
      "sentPy": "Jīntiān xīngqīwǔ, fàng xué le, bàba zài chē shang gàosu wǒ: “Xiàwǔ yǒu yí ge xiǎo péngyou lái wǒmen jiā.”",
      "sentEn": "Today is Friday and class is over. In the car, Dad tells me, \"A little friend is coming to our home this afternoon.\"",
